### Series 800

Defines Research as the foundational exploratory mechanism of future system evolution.

---

# SYSTEM ROLE

The Research subsystem functions as the discovery engine of the LEGAiSEE CommandCenter.

It systematically explores unknowns, evaluates possibilities, and generates structured knowledge that informs the evolution of the system.

It ensures that future development is based on evidence, analysis, and structured reasoning rather than assumption.

---

# GUIDING PRINCIPLE

> **A system cannot improve what it does not understand.
> Research transforms uncertainty into structured knowledge.
> Structured knowledge enables intentional evolution.**

